{"source":"BMKG — Peringatan Dini Cuaca (nowcast)","feed":"https://www.bmkg.go.id/alerts/nowcast/id/rss.xml","checkedAt":"2026-10-03T23:45:15.038Z","alerts":[{"id":"2.49.0.1.360.0.2026.10.03.23.11.009","link":"https://www.bmkg.go.id/alerts/nowcast/id/CAH20261003009_alert.xml","event":"Hujan Lebat dan Petir","headline":"Hujan Lebat disertai Petir di Aceh","description":"Hujan lebat disertai petir akan terjadi pada 04 October 2026, 05:09 WIB di sebagian wilayah Aceh, khususnya di BABUL RAHMAH, BAKONGAN, BAKONGAN TIMUR, DANAU PARIS, GUNUNG MERIAH, KOTA BAHAGIA, KOTA BAHARU, KUALA BARU, LONGKIB, PENANGGALAN, PULAU BANYAK, PULAU BANYAK BARAT, RUNDENG, SIMPANG KANAN, SIMPANG KIRI, SINGKIL, SINGKOHOR, SULTAN DAULAT, SURO MAKMUR, TEUPAH SELATAN, TRUMON, TRUMON TENGAH, TRUMON TIMUR.\n Kondisi ini berpotensi menimbulkan dampak berupa jarak pandang berkurang, angin kencang, dan banjir lokal.\n Masyarakat dihimbau untuk tetap waspada, mengurangi aktivitas di luar ruangan, serta mengambil langkah-langkah pencegahan yang diperlukan guna menjaga keselamatan.\n Kondisi diperkirakan dapat berlangsung hingga 04 October 2026, 08:30 WIB.","impact":"jarak pandang berkurang, angin kencang, dan banjir lokal","severity":"Moderate","urgency":"Immediate","certainty":"Observed","sent":1791064740000,"effective":1791065340000,"expires":1791077400000,"infographic":"https://nowcasting.bmkg.go.id/infografis/CAH/2026/10/04/infografis.jpg","province":"Aceh","districts":{"primary":["BABUL RAHMAH","BAKONGAN","BAKONGAN TIMUR","DANAU PARIS","GUNUNG MERIAH","KOTA BAHAGIA","KOTA BAHARU","KUALA BARU","LONGKIB","PENANGGALAN","PULAU BANYAK","PULAU BANYAK BARAT","RUNDENG","SIMPANG KANAN","SIMPANG KIRI","SINGKIL","SINGKOHOR","SULTAN DAULAT","SURO MAKMUR","TEUPAH SELATAN","TRUMON","TRUMON TENGAH","TRUMON TIMUR"],"extended":[]},"polygons":[[[2.923,97.515],[2.912,97.5],[2.922,97.482],[2.925,97.444],[2.934,97.425],[2.96,97.397],[3.002,97.446],[3.011,97.463],[2.965,97.505],[2.955,97.508],[2.937,97.507],[2.923,97.51